# Fixed version of timing_leak.ta: a wrong first byte is still answered
# only after 3 time units (constant-time comparison).
#   ./build/automata et-opacity examples/timing_constant.ta first_ok done 10
clocks x
locations start first_ok wait done
initial start
invariant start x<=1
invariant first_ok x<=3
invariant wait x<=3
edge start wait first_byte_wrong guard=x==1
edge start first_ok first_byte_correct guard=x==1
edge wait done answer guard=x==3
edge first_ok done answer guard=x==3
